{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19950","headline":"和皇甫判官游琅琊溪 · 孟郊","name":"和皇甫判官游琅琊溪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山中琉璃境，物外琅琊溪。\n房廊逐岩壑，道路随高低。\n碧濑漱白石，翠烟含青蜺。\n客来暂游践，意欲忘簪珪。\n树杪灯火夕，云端钟梵齐。\n时同虽可仰，迹异难相携。\n唯当清宵梦，髣髴愿攀跻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}